/**
 * @mainpage ArgusAI Documentation
 *
 * @section intro_sec Introduction
 * ArgusAI is an advanced AI-powered object detection and segmentation system that provides real-time analysis of images and video streams. The system leverages state-of-the-art YOLO (You Only Look Once) models to deliver high-performance object detection and instance segmentation capabilities.
 *
 * @section features_sec Key Features
 * - Real-time object detection using YOLOv8
 * - Instance segmentation capabilities
 * - Support for multiple object classes
 * - Configurable detection parameters
 * - RESTful API interface
 * - Modern web-based user interface
 *
 * @section arch_sec Architecture
 * The system is built with a modern client-server architecture:
 * - @ref backend "Backend": FastAPI-based REST API server
 * - @ref frontend "Frontend": React-based web interface
 *
 * @section modules_sec Core Modules
 * - @ref detection "Object Detection": Core detection functionality
 * - @ref segmentation "Instance Segmentation": Segmentation capabilities
 * - @ref api "API Interface": REST API endpoints
 * - @ref ui "User Interface": Web-based UI components
 *
 * @section usage_sec Usage
 * The system can be used through:
 * 1. Web Interface: Access the user-friendly web interface at http://localhost:5173
 * 2. API: Make direct API calls to the backend endpoints
 *
 * @section setup_sec Setup and Installation
 * See the @ref installation "Installation Guide" for detailed setup instructions.
 *
 * @section api_sec API Documentation
 * The complete API documentation is available in the @ref api "API Reference" section.
 *
 * @section examples_sec Examples
 * Check the @ref examples "Examples" section for usage examples and code snippets.
 *
 * @section license_sec License
 * This project is licensed under the MIT License - see the LICENSE file for details.
 */ 